flowchart TB
  U[Специалист акимата] --> UI[React UI · карта MapLibre · Three.js]
  UI --> BFF[FastAPI / BFF · OIDC session · CSRF · grants]
  IDP[OIDC / Keycloak] <--> BFF
  BFF --> DOMAIN[Domain use cases · версии · правила]
  DOMAIN --> CALC[Смета · survival · care · priority · ecosystem]
  DOMAIN --> DB[(PostgreSQL / PostGIS)]
  DOMAIN --> OUTBOX[Transactional outbox / Job]
  OUTBOX --> QUEUE[Redis / Celery queues]
  QUEUE --> WORKERS[Import · optimization · physical · export workers]
  WORKERS --> DB
  WORKERS --> STORE[(Исходники · COG · manifests · отчёты)]
  DB --> TILES[MVT / authorized feature API]
  STORE --> BASE[PMTiles / Range / локальные assets]
  TILES --> UI
  BASE --> UI
  BFF --> AI[LLM adapter · RAG ACL · bounded tools]
  AI --> DOMAIN
  DOMAIN --> AUDIT[Audit · traces · metrics]
